WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.722
Mr. Brown: Today is the last day of school.

2
00:00:05.723 --> 00:00:08.777
Class: YEAH!

3
00:00:08.778 --> 00:00:12.926
Mr. Brown: Do you have any special plans for the summer?

4
00:00:12.927 --> 00:00:21.894
Veronica: Mr. Brown! My family is going to Europe

5
00:00:21.895 --> 00:00:25.820
again. Mr. Brown: That’s nice, Veronica.

6
00:00:25.821 --> 00:00:29.892
Ricky? Ricky: Brian and I are going to visit

7
00:00:29.893 --> 00:00:34.446
Brenda. Veronica: Brenda’s his old

8
00:00:34.447 --> 00:00:40.043
girlfriend. Ricky: Brian and I are taking the bus to her

9
00:00:40.044 --> 00:00:44.103
house. Mr. Brown: Kitty, what are you doing this

10
00:00:44.104 --> 00:00:47.566
summer? Kitty: My family is going

11
00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:53.424
camping. Mr. Brown: Good. Now for your homework . .

12
00:00:53.425 --> 00:00:58.408
. Keep a diary and take photos during your vacation.

13
00:00:58.409 --> 00:01:02.285
Mr. Brown: Have a great summer!

14
00:01:02.286 --> 00:01:06.286
Class: You too, Mr. Brown!

15
00:01:06.287 --> 00:01:09.668
Ricky: See you around!

16
00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:15.193
Kitty and Katy: Have fun at Brenda’s!

